--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn: IEA-15MW UMaine VolturnUS-S, the lazy-wave power cable of the mixed example deck alone,
restrained in torsion at both ends (CompMooring = 5), for the CableXSec reader tests.
