LineID  LineType  Length  NumSegs
(-)     (-)       (m)     (-)
1       bare      80.0    40
1       buoy      100.0    40
1       bare      420.0    168
--------------------------- END CONNECTIONS -----------------------------------
LineID  End  Stiffness  EzX   EzY  EzZ    TorsStiffness  NxX  NxY  NxZ  Pretwist
(-)     (-)  (N-m/rad)  (-)   (-)  (-)    (N-m/rad)      (-)  (-)  (-)  (deg)
1       A    Pinned     0.2   0.0  -0.98  Rigid          0.0  1.0  0.0  0.0
1       B    Pinned     1.0   0.0  0.0    Rigid          0.0  1.0  0.0  0.0
--------------------------- OPTIONS -------------------------------------------
3.0e6     kBot             - Seabed penalty stiffness base (Pa/m)
3.0e5     cBot             - Seabed normal damping base (Pa-s/m)
0.35      frictionMu       - Coulomb seabed-friction coefficient
0.4       rhoInf           - Generalised-alpha spectral radius
False     modified_newton  - Full Newton
False     adaptive_mesh    - No refinement
dynamic_solver 1.0e-8 1.0e-14 30 12 - Relative tolerance, absolute tolerance, max iterations, backtracks
0.025     dtM              - CableDyn step (s); OpenFAST rounds it to whole glue steps
none      current          - No current
none      waves            - Waves from the host
SEASTATE  WaterKin         - Water kinematics from SeaState
